<title>UK: SW Water sees windall tax cost 100 mln stg.</title>
<headline>SW Water sees windall tax cost 100 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's South West Water Plc on Thursday estimated it was liable to pay about 100 million stg on the government's windfall tax.</p>
</text>
